# Purpose

The Philips TV Module provides seamless integration between Aura and supported Philips Smart TVs.

The module is responsible for discovery, authentication, communication, state synchronization and diagnostics.

Users should never need to understand how Philips TVs work internally.

Aura abstracts all complexity behind a simple, elegant interface.

