# Security

All communication occurs over the local network whenever possible.

No unnecessary cloud communication.

Credentials stored securely.

Authentication tokens stored in Keychain.

Never store passwords.

---

# Privacy

Aura never transmits viewing history externally.

Aura never uploads device information.

All device metadata remains local.

Privacy is a core feature.

