# Acceptance Criteria

Aura automatically discovers compatible Philips TVs.

Users can pair the TV without reading documentation.

Power, volume, input switching and remote navigation function reliably.

State remains synchronized.

Network interruptions recover automatically.

Unsupported features are hidden rather than disabled.

Latency remains within performance targets.

